1
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,870
- Oh, dear!
- What?

2
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:08,260
(Sheldon:)Raj's television.

3
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,630
(Sheldon:)I just realized

4
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:12,230
(Sheldon:)we're about to spend an evening
watching a plasma screen

5
00:00:12,230 --> 00:00:15,470
(Sheldon:)with a cluster of dead pixels
in the upper left-hand corner.

6
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:17,020
(Leonard:)So don't watch TV.

7
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,270
(Leonard:)Read a book.

8
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,910
(Sheldon:)And be a social pariah?

9
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,840
(Sheldon:)Oh, you know
that's not my style.

10
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,310
(Leonard:)Ugh!

11
00:00:26,180 --> 00:00:29,750
(Sheldon:)The audible sigh is a show
of exasperation, right?

12
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:30,950
(Leonard:)Right.

13
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:33,820
(Sheldon:)Is it about me
or the dead pixels?

14
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:36,660
(Raj:)Hey, you're
just in time.

15
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,960
(Raj:)We made Tex-Mex.

16
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,160
(Leonard:)Oh, sounds great.

17
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:41,160
(Sheldon:)Oh, Indians
making Tex-Mex.

18
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,530
(Sheldon:)Might as well have had
the Chinese pizza.

19
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,370
(Raj:)Hey, you.

20
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:48,600
(Leonard:)Hi.

21
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:51,040
(Howard:)That's got to be fun
for you, huh?

22
00:00:52,440 --> 00:00:54,840
(Howard:)Watching Hofstadter
suck the saliva

23
00:00:54,840 --> 00:00:56,310
(Howard:)out of your sister's mouth?

24
00:00:57,540 --> 00:01:00,010
(Sheldon:)Excuse me. Before this evening
goes any further,

25
00:01:00,010 --> 00:01:03,180
(Sheldon:)we need to decide
where everyone is going to sit.

